<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="The Open Home Foundation merch store is temporarily closed while we upgrade how we manage and ship orders. Reopening the first week of October."
    />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <title>Store temporarily closed — Open Home Foundation</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <img
        class="logo"
        src="https://brands.openhomefoundation.org/api/open-home-foundation/logo/screen/lockup/main/color/light/svg"
        alt="Open Home Foundation"
      />
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="card">
        <div class="content">
          <p class="eyebrow">
            <!-- TODO: replace with the small icon asset -->
            <svg
              class="eyebrow-icon"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path>
              <path d="M9 22V12h6v10"></path>
            </svg>
            Store temporarily closed
          </p>

          <h1>Be right back&hellip;</h1>

          <p>
            We&rsquo;re upgrading how we manage and ship your orders, which
            means closing our doors for a short while to get everything
            sorted.
          </p>

          <p>The store will reopen in the first week of October.</p>

          <p>
            Already placed an order? It&rsquo;s safe, and will be processed as
            usual. If you have any questions, feel free to reach out
            at <a href="mailto:merchsupport@openhomefoundation.org">merchsupport@openhomefoundation.org</a>.
          </p>

          <p>We look forward to welcoming you back soon!</p>

          <a class="button" href="mailto:merchsupport@openhomefoundation.org"
            >Reach out</a
          >
        </div>

        <!-- TODO: illustration asset goes here, e.g.
        <img class="illustration" src="/moving.svg" alt="" /> -->
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p class="tagline">Privacy, Choice, Sustainability</p>
      <a href="https://www.openhomefoundation.org">openhomefoundation.org</a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #ededed;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --heading: #253746;
    --text: #5f6b76;
    --accent: #78bce8;
    --accent-hover: #5eaee2;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  html,
  body {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100%;
  }

  body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.7;
    text-align: center;
  }

  header .logo {
    width: clamp(14rem, 40vw, 18rem);
    height: auto;
  }

  .card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    max-width: 52rem;
    padding: 3rem;
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: 1rem;
  }

  .content {
    max-width: 34rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .eyebrow-icon {
    width: 1.1rem;
    height: 1.1rem;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.5rem);
  }

  p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  a {
    color: var(--accent-hover);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .button {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.6rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .button:hover {
    background: var(--accent-hover);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .illustration {
    flex: 0 0 16rem;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  footer .tagline {
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
    color: var(--heading);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  footer a {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .card {
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .illustration {
      flex: none;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 12rem;
    }
  }
</style>
